{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47747","headline":"题游帷观真君殿後 · 伊用昌","name":"题游帷观真君殿後","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"日日祥云瑞气连，侬家应作大神仙。\n笔头洒起风雷力，劒下驱驰造化权。\n更与戎夷添礼乐，永教胡虏绝烽烟。\n列仙功业只如此，直上三清第一天。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"伊用昌","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47747.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47747","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}